Choose furniture (or `floor` for standing/ground) based on `recent_events`, mood, and physical dynamic rather than shortest distance: `bed` suits relaxed or prolonged intimacy; `chair`, `bench`, `table`, `wall`, etc. offer situational variety when they fit the moment; `floor` suits standing, spontaneous, or ground encounters.{% if length(_furnNearby.actorIds) > 1 %} Other people are nearby — if the characters want privacy from bystanders, `bed` implies retreating to a private sleeping area.{% endif %}
